# Third-party notices - Heart of Magic - NPC Spells @NPCSPELLS_VERSION@

This file, `LICENSE` and `licenses/` sit in `SKSE/Plugins/HeartOfMagic_NPCSpells/` of the archive (the archive
is laid out as the game's Data folder; nothing reads this folder).

## Licenses

- **The plugin DLL is a GPL-3.0-or-later combined work.** `SKSE/Plugins/HeartOfMagic_NPCSpells.dll` statically
  links **CommonLibSSE-NG 10.0.0**, which is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later with the **Modding Exception** and the
  **GPL-3.0 Linking Exception**. The DLL is distributed under those terms:
  `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/COPYING.txt` (GNU GPL version 3) and `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/EXCEPTIONS.md`
  (the two exceptions).
- **The addon's own source files are MIT** (`LICENSE` next to this file): the C++ in the repository's
  `plugins/NPCSpells/` and the Heart of Magic files it compiles in (`plugins/spelllearning/src/EncodingUtils.cpp`,
  `plugins/spelllearning/src/tomereach/TomeReachConfig.cpp`, `TomeReachRecords.cpp`), the ESL
  `HeartOfMagic_NPCSpells.esp` (written by `tools/npcspells-esl`) and the rules file
  `SKSE/Plugins/HeartOfMagic_NPCSpells.json`. MIT is compatible with the GPL; files you take from this project on
  their own stay MIT.

## Corresponding Source

The complete Corresponding Source for the DLL is public at
<https://github.com/Iwillbewarlock/HeartOfMagic>, tag `npcspells-v@NPCSPELLS_VERSION@` (the tag of this release).
CommonLibSSE-NG is its git submodule `plugins/external/commonlibsse-ng` at tag `v10.0.0`
(<https://github.com/alandtse/CommonLibVR>, branch `ng`); `git submodule update --init --recursive`
fetches it. The third-party libraries below come from the vcpkg manifest `vcpkg.json`. Building:
`BuildRelease.ps1` (see the repository's README and CLAUDE.md, and `plugins/NPCSpells/README.md`).

## Libraries in the DLL

Linked statically or compiled in from headers (vcpkg triplet `x64-windows-static`): the libraries the DLL's
target links (`plugins/NPCSpells/CMakeLists.txt`: spdlog, which brings {fmt}, nlohmann-json, zlib) and those
CommonLibSSE-NG links or compiles in for this build (DirectXTK and DirectXMath, Xbyak for its trampoline). Their
license texts are in `licenses/`.

| Library | Version | License | License text |
|---|---|---|---|
| CommonLibSSE-NG | 10.0.0 | GPL-3.0-or-later + Modding Exception + GPL-3.0 Linking Exception | `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/COPYING.txt`, `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/EXCEPTIONS.md` |
| CommonLibSSE (the original code by Ryan-rsm-McKenzie that CommonLibSSE-NG grew from) | - | MIT (kept for attribution) | `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/LICENSE-MIT.txt` |
| {fmt} | 12.1.0 | MIT | `licenses/fmt.txt` |
| spdlog | 1.17.0 | MIT | `licenses/spdlog.txt` |
| JSON for Modern C++ (nlohmann-json) | 3.12.0 | MIT | `licenses/nlohmann-json.txt` |
| zlib | 1.3.1 | Zlib | `licenses/zlib.txt` |
| Xbyak | 7.28 | BSD-3-Clause | `licenses/xbyak.txt` |
| DirectXMath | 2025-04-03 | MIT | `licenses/directxmath.txt` |
| DirectX Tool Kit (DirectXTK) | 2025-10-27 | MIT | `licenses/directxtk.txt` |

The Microsoft C/C++ runtime (CRT) is linked statically under the Visual Studio redistribution terms.
